## 四、通知分流逻辑

```java
private void dispatchNotify(String location, List<DisasterInfo> disasters) {
    // 分离一级灾害和其他
    List<DisasterInfo> level1 = disasters.stream()
            .filter(d -> d.getLevel() == 1)
            .collect(Collectors.toList());
    
    List<DisasterInfo> others = disasters.stream()
            .filter(d -> d.getLevel() > 1)
            .collect(Collectors.toList());
    
    // 一级灾害：通知该地区所有用户
    if (!level1.isEmpty()) {
        notifyAllUsers(location, level1);
    }
    
    // 二/三级灾害：通知匹配任务的用户
    for (DisasterInfo disaster : others) {
        notifyMatchingUsers(location, disaster);
    }
}

// 一级灾害：全员通知
private void notifyAllUsers(String location, List<DisasterInfo> disasters) {
    List<UserInfo> users = userService.getUsersByLocation(location);
    for (UserInfo user : users) {
        emailService.sendDisasterAlert(user.getEmail(), location, disasters);
    }
}

// 二/三级灾害：匹配通知
private void notifyMatchingUsers(String location, DisasterInfo disaster) {
    List<ReminderTaskVO> tasks = reminderTaskService
            .getPendingTasksByLocation(location);
    
    for (ReminderTaskVO task : tasks) {
        // 天气码值匹配
        if (task.getConcernCondition().equals(disaster.getWeatherCode())) {
            UserInfo user = userService.getById(task.getUserId());
            emailService.sendReminder(user.getEmail(), task, disaster);
            
            // 一次性任务标记为已执行
            if (task.getTaskType() == 0) {
                reminderTaskService.markTaskAsExecuted(task.getId());
            }
        }
    }
}
```

